WEBVTT

00:00.981 --> 00:02.981
[♪ opening theme song playing]

01:34.101 --> 01:36.271
[indistinct chatter]

01:42.601 --> 01:43.521
Hmm.

01:43.601 --> 01:45.521
Yeah, I'm feelin' lucky.

01:48.851 --> 01:49.731
Uh.

01:54.851 --> 01:56.191
Hmm.

01:56.271 --> 01:57.601
[GAMBLER]
This can't be happening!

01:58.601 --> 02:01.231
-[grumbles]
-[chuckles] Oh, but it can.

02:01.311 --> 02:02.601
When a player has a skill issue.

02:02.691 --> 02:04.151
It's not skill!

02:04.231 --> 02:06.481
No one draws winners
one after another!

02:06.561 --> 02:07.601
-[JOOHEON] Hey.
-[gasps]

02:08.231 --> 02:09.731
If you're done here, get lost.

02:10.231 --> 02:12.271
I was hoping to play a round
against these guys.

02:12.351 --> 02:13.311
Bite me.

02:13.981 --> 02:14.811
-[growls]
-[gambler gasps]

02:14.901 --> 02:16.311
[gasps]

02:16.401 --> 02:18.271
[scoffs] Today sucks.

02:18.901 --> 02:21.401
Well, you're a new face.

02:22.021 --> 02:23.521
So let's get better acquainted.

02:23.601 --> 02:24.811
[chuckles]

02:24.901 --> 02:25.811
Sit.

02:25.901 --> 02:28.811
[♪ dramatic music playing]

02:28.901 --> 02:30.101
[JOOHEON] Straight.

02:30.191 --> 02:31.481
Four of a kind.

02:31.941 --> 02:33.191
Three aces.

02:34.811 --> 02:36.441
-Royal flush!
-[all gasp]

02:36.941 --> 02:38.521
I can't lose.

02:38.601 --> 02:39.651
No way this is real.

02:42.231 --> 02:43.151
[JOOHEON] Hmm.

02:46.231 --> 02:47.601
[smirks]

02:47.691 --> 02:50.151
"The Lucky Coin Blessed
by the Goddess of Fortune."

02:50.811 --> 02:52.231
It was tossed
into a wishing well

02:52.311 --> 02:53.771
and eventually became a relic.

02:55.271 --> 02:57.021
[gasps] What? How'd you know?

02:57.101 --> 02:58.311
[JOOHEON]
With your winning streak?

02:58.401 --> 02:59.651
Hard not to.

03:00.271 --> 03:02.191
Thing is, it's just C-rank.

03:03.191 --> 03:05.151
No match with the double S
Bankruptcy aura

03:05.231 --> 03:06.401
you're enveloped in.

03:06.481 --> 03:08.061
[chuckling]

03:09.521 --> 03:11.061
[BODYGUARD]
And this is the right way?

03:12.521 --> 03:14.061
Um, Miss Holton?

03:14.851 --> 03:17.101
[JOOHEON]
Her control has really improved.

03:18.231 --> 03:19.941
Now that everyone here
is being pumped

03:20.021 --> 03:22.151
with bad luck
except Jaeha and me,

03:22.231 --> 03:24.901
even an average hand I play
is bound to win.

03:27.151 --> 03:28.481
Take it and hit the road.

03:28.561 --> 03:29.521
[JOOHEON] I want more.

03:29.601 --> 03:31.441
More? This is all you wagered.

03:31.521 --> 03:33.651
Cheating should
have a penalty, though.

03:34.101 --> 03:35.851
Each of you owes $1 million.

03:35.941 --> 03:37.601
What? Penalty?

03:37.691 --> 03:39.441
-Who died and made you the--
-[Jooheon grunts]

03:40.061 --> 03:41.271
[all gasp]

03:42.191 --> 03:43.311
Please.

03:43.401 --> 03:45.311
You didn't think
you'd get off scot-free.

03:45.401 --> 03:46.601
That's just stupid.

03:46.691 --> 03:48.351
-[gasps]
-[JOOHEON] Generous as I am,

03:48.441 --> 03:50.771
I'll accept forms of payment
other than cash.

03:51.771 --> 03:54.021
Like the Xu Fu relic
that lures children.

03:54.101 --> 03:54.981
That works.

03:55.901 --> 03:56.771
Huh?

03:57.401 --> 03:58.521
And then,

03:58.601 --> 04:00.351
tell me exactly
what Kiera's doing here.

04:00.441 --> 04:01.401
In full detail.

04:01.481 --> 04:03.101
Oh, I get it.

04:03.771 --> 04:06.351
Bastard.
You planned this from the start.

04:06.441 --> 04:08.651
Well, you won't get
a single word out of--

04:08.731 --> 04:11.561
[screaming, grunting]

04:11.651 --> 04:13.981
-[screaming]
-Hey. Hey! Mary!

04:16.481 --> 04:18.561
[all groaning]

04:18.651 --> 04:20.061
[gasps]

04:20.151 --> 04:21.811
Irene strikes again.

04:21.901 --> 04:24.231
[Mary and colleagues screaming]

04:24.811 --> 04:26.151
They're screaming.

04:26.231 --> 04:27.521
Maybe you-- [gasps]

04:30.731 --> 04:31.771
Miss Holton?

04:31.851 --> 04:34.271
[grunting in pain]

04:34.351 --> 04:35.441
I'll talk!

04:35.901 --> 04:38.061
Make it stop, and I'll tell you!

04:39.311 --> 04:40.691
[JOOHEON] She changed her tune.

04:40.771 --> 04:42.271
This worked out beautifully.

04:42.351 --> 04:44.731
Glad you came around.
Let's hear it.

04:44.811 --> 04:47.401
Go north,
till you get to a forest.

04:47.481 --> 04:48.811
It has a tomb!

04:48.901 --> 04:51.521
I don't know where Kiera is,
but... [groans]

04:51.601 --> 04:53.351
Xu Fu's relic is there.

04:53.441 --> 04:54.811
-[door opens]
-[gasps]

04:54.901 --> 04:55.901
Miss Holton's gone!

04:55.981 --> 04:57.561
-She ran off!
-[both gasp]

04:57.651 --> 04:58.851
[gasps]

04:58.941 --> 05:00.901
[panting] No.

05:03.101 --> 05:04.521
Where'd you go, Irene?

05:04.601 --> 05:05.941
Answer me!

05:06.021 --> 05:07.351
-[panting]
-Hmm?

05:08.561 --> 05:10.731
Damn it. The risk took effect.

05:11.271 --> 05:12.481
That has to be why.

05:12.561 --> 05:14.191
I gave her too much to handle.

05:14.271 --> 05:15.851
If something happened,
it's my fault!

05:15.941 --> 05:16.811
[grunts]

05:17.601 --> 05:20.401
[panting]

05:20.481 --> 05:22.691
Running around blindly
won't get me anywhere.

05:22.771 --> 05:24.901
Just breathe and focus.

05:24.981 --> 05:27.691
Sense her relic's aura
and follow the trail.

05:27.771 --> 05:30.151
[takes deep breath]

05:30.901 --> 05:31.851
[grunts]

05:39.771 --> 05:41.101
Found her.

05:41.601 --> 05:42.521
Back that way.

05:42.601 --> 05:43.901
She's close!

05:45.601 --> 05:48.941
[panting]

05:53.811 --> 05:55.521
[sighs]

05:56.151 --> 05:57.441
We have our hotel rooms.

05:58.271 --> 05:59.561
Why'd she come here?

06:08.061 --> 06:08.941
Mm.

06:10.561 --> 06:11.941
[chuckles] Uh.

06:13.021 --> 06:14.521
Jooheon.

06:15.521 --> 06:16.691
Is she...

06:17.481 --> 06:18.441
Ah.

06:19.351 --> 06:21.191
It's the real Jooheon.

06:21.941 --> 06:23.851
How are you feeling? [grunts]

06:24.771 --> 06:26.271
W-What are you doing?

06:28.101 --> 06:30.441
[grunting]

06:31.561 --> 06:32.731
[Irene chuckling]

06:33.441 --> 06:34.601
[JOOHEON] This is...

06:34.691 --> 06:37.101
the relic, right?

06:38.731 --> 06:40.901
[gasping]

06:40.981 --> 06:41.981
[gasps]

06:42.061 --> 06:44.851
♪

07:01.851 --> 07:03.101
[sighs]

07:10.101 --> 07:12.521
[grumbles] No, duh!
That much is clear!

07:12.601 --> 07:16.691
Tell me these things in advance,
you stupid feathered bastard!

07:20.601 --> 07:22.151
[KIERA] A Holton private jet?

07:22.771 --> 07:25.271
Yes. So he's either working
with one of the Holtons,

07:25.351 --> 07:27.601
or secretly teamed up
with someone connected to them.

07:28.231 --> 07:29.521
We have the jet's course.

07:29.601 --> 07:31.101
They're en route to Ghana.

07:31.191 --> 07:33.191
A Holton in Ghana?

07:33.271 --> 07:35.601
[smirks] I think I know why.

07:43.311 --> 07:44.441
[JOOHEON] Hmm.

07:48.311 --> 07:50.271
[JOOHEON]
Only children are allowed in.

07:50.351 --> 07:53.191
Which means
Xu Fu's relic really is here.

07:57.561 --> 08:01.481
So, Kiera conquered the tomb,
but chose not to seal it.

08:01.561 --> 08:03.061
Question is why?

08:04.231 --> 08:06.441
Give me the weakest relic
you have on you.

08:07.061 --> 08:09.941
Dude! Are you gonna do
what I think you are?

08:10.561 --> 08:11.441
[smirks]

08:12.061 --> 08:15.021
[flint relic groans]
That's not what I'm used for!

08:17.771 --> 08:20.191
[Jaeha yelling]

08:21.151 --> 08:24.101
Could we please
use a normal entrance for once?

08:24.191 --> 08:25.981
I can't take
these explosive detours.

08:26.061 --> 08:27.311
I need more lives!

08:27.401 --> 08:29.151
Being with you
will cost 100 at least!

08:29.231 --> 08:31.101
Uh. Mm.

08:34.731 --> 08:36.231
Aha!

08:36.691 --> 08:37.651
How 'bout that?

08:37.731 --> 08:39.481
Got service and everything.

08:39.561 --> 08:41.231
[JAEHA] Yeah. Good stuff.

08:41.941 --> 08:43.521
-But look up.
-Hmm?

08:44.151 --> 08:45.061
[both gasp]

08:45.151 --> 08:46.061
Hmm.

08:46.151 --> 08:48.271
♪

08:48.351 --> 08:51.851
[JAEHA] It's a huge field,
but somehow underground?

08:51.941 --> 08:53.731
With just kids working on it.

08:54.151 --> 08:56.021
They seem
a little too dedicated.

08:56.401 --> 08:58.401
That explosion
didn't even faze them.

08:58.481 --> 09:01.441
It's like
they're in a hypnotic trance.

09:02.061 --> 09:03.851
Something is definitely off.

09:11.021 --> 09:11.981
Hmm.

09:18.521 --> 09:19.901
A minotaur.

09:19.981 --> 09:21.231
Well, well.

09:21.311 --> 09:23.191
A legendary figure
with a human body

09:23.271 --> 09:25.061
and a bull's head
related to tea leaves

09:25.151 --> 09:26.941
can only mean one thing.

09:28.061 --> 09:30.981
This tea field was made
by Shennong's relic.

09:31.061 --> 09:32.981
[gasps] Shennong?

09:33.061 --> 09:35.481
[JOOHEON] He was the inventor
of the first farming tools

09:35.561 --> 09:37.481
and taught mankind agriculture.

09:39.061 --> 09:40.191
He'd also sample plants

09:40.561 --> 09:42.851
to see which were medicinal
and which were poisonous,

09:42.941 --> 09:45.061
then neutralize
any toxins he ingested

09:45.151 --> 09:46.601
by chewing on tea leaves.

09:48.561 --> 09:50.521
What about the relic of Xu Fu?

09:51.351 --> 09:53.351
It should be tucked away
somewhere close.

09:54.061 --> 09:55.441
This tea field must've been here

09:55.521 --> 09:57.481
when Kiera's team
came to excavate.

09:58.981 --> 10:00.811
Closing the tomb
would destroy the field,

10:00.901 --> 10:03.481
so she left it open in order
to farm the tea leaves.

10:04.651 --> 10:07.021
Problem is,
only children are allowed entry.

10:07.101 --> 10:08.351
But with Xu Fu's relic,

10:08.441 --> 10:10.191
she could lure tons
of local kids inside

10:10.271 --> 10:11.981
to be her diligent workers.

10:14.101 --> 10:16.851
So, I say we make
this trip twice as worthwhile

10:16.941 --> 10:18.691
and bag ourselves two relics.

10:19.271 --> 10:20.521
No, Jooheon, wait!

10:20.601 --> 10:21.651
-The kids look mad!
-Huh?

10:21.731 --> 10:22.981
Uh?

10:23.061 --> 10:25.401
[growls]

10:26.191 --> 10:28.521
[growling]

10:28.601 --> 10:30.901
[grunting]

10:32.521 --> 10:33.481
[BODYGUARD] Get down!

10:33.561 --> 10:34.691
[groans]

10:35.901 --> 10:37.061
Rope of Heaven!

10:37.441 --> 10:41.521
-Tie all these crazy kids up!
-[ROPE] Here I go! Woo!

10:41.601 --> 10:44.691
Play time, play time!
Whoop diddly-dee!

10:45.311 --> 10:47.771
Lots of playmates all for me!

10:47.851 --> 10:49.811
[sighs] Made it.

10:49.901 --> 10:51.271
-Huh?
-Everything good over there?

10:51.901 --> 10:53.271
Yes. We're both fine.

10:54.101 --> 10:55.311
[JOOHEON] Hmm.

10:55.401 --> 10:56.691
Why hello, relic.

10:56.771 --> 10:58.401
You're just oozing with aura.

10:58.481 --> 11:00.021
I barely had to look for you.

11:01.941 --> 11:03.021
Hmm. [grunts]

11:03.101 --> 11:05.061
[panting]

11:05.151 --> 11:06.271
[grunts]

11:07.651 --> 11:10.061
-[smirks]
-[worm screaming]

11:10.151 --> 11:13.231
Get off!
Get off me right this instant!

11:13.311 --> 11:15.731
Weird. Think I hear a voice.

11:15.811 --> 11:17.561
Oh. It's you.

11:17.651 --> 11:19.981
[worm grunts]
How did you find me?

11:20.061 --> 11:21.191
I'm tiny!

11:21.851 --> 11:25.021
The second you lost your cool,
you gave yourself away.

11:25.101 --> 11:26.021
[WORM] Curses.

11:26.101 --> 11:28.021
What kind of human are you?

11:28.101 --> 11:29.151
[smirks]

11:29.601 --> 11:30.771
[scoffs]

11:30.851 --> 11:33.061
[WORM] Well,
tricks only get you so far!

11:33.151 --> 11:34.771
-[scoffs]
-Easy.

11:34.851 --> 11:36.981
I come in peace, not to fight.

11:37.691 --> 11:38.901
[worm gasps]

11:38.981 --> 11:39.901
You do?

11:39.981 --> 11:41.851
Absolutely.

11:41.941 --> 11:44.481
Calm down,
and let's make a deal.

11:44.561 --> 11:45.731
Everyone's got a weakness,

11:45.811 --> 11:47.231
and I know what yours is.

11:47.311 --> 11:48.481
It's money.

11:48.561 --> 11:50.311
What's it cost to buy you?

11:50.401 --> 11:52.101
Wait, I'm confused.

11:52.191 --> 11:54.311
Are you really negotiating
with a relic?

11:55.231 --> 11:57.061
This little guy's
an extortionist.

11:57.151 --> 11:59.151
The same way that Xu Fu was.

11:59.231 --> 12:01.981
Can't be stingy if you wanna
form a contract with it.

12:02.061 --> 12:03.651
It sells out?

12:03.731 --> 12:04.851
[WORM] Ooh!

12:04.941 --> 12:07.021
You're a man
I can do business with.

12:07.101 --> 12:09.021
But you're gonna lose
that cocky grin

12:09.101 --> 12:11.151
when you hear my hefty price.

12:11.771 --> 12:12.651
[JOOHEON] Here's two million.

12:13.271 --> 12:15.401
[ALL] What? $2 million?

12:15.481 --> 12:16.651
But that's overkill!

12:16.731 --> 12:19.811
[WORM] Oho!
The feel of authentic money!

12:19.901 --> 12:21.481
It's not enough
to suffice, though.

12:21.561 --> 12:22.691
-[Jooheon grunts]
-[WORM] Oh!

12:22.771 --> 12:24.441
[JOOHEON]
And here's another two mil.

12:24.521 --> 12:25.651
All for you.

12:25.731 --> 12:29.731
[worm laughs]
It's raining money!

12:29.811 --> 12:32.061
With that, are you willing
to come work under me?

12:32.151 --> 12:33.441
[WORM] Nope.

12:33.521 --> 12:36.441
It's a start, but still
not enough. [chuckles]

12:36.521 --> 12:39.691
My current owner's down payment
was considerably higher.

12:39.771 --> 12:41.941
[JOOHEON] Jeez, Kiera.

12:42.021 --> 12:44.151
How much did you spend
to make this worm bite?

12:45.311 --> 12:48.691
I added my emergency reserve
and some expensive jewelry.

12:48.771 --> 12:50.601
Even had to throw in my watch.

12:51.311 --> 12:52.981
Then, Irene offered
a property too.

12:53.061 --> 12:54.311
[Irene laughs] Here you go!

12:54.401 --> 12:56.101
[WORM] Woo-hoo-hoo!

12:56.191 --> 12:58.101
I like an owner
who doesn't hold back,

12:58.191 --> 12:59.481
so the deal is done!

13:01.101 --> 13:02.981
What can I do for you,
moneybags?

13:03.061 --> 13:05.351
Ah! I thought
you didn't wanna hurt me!

13:05.441 --> 13:06.601
What's with the jar?

13:07.061 --> 13:08.231
It's insurance.

13:08.311 --> 13:10.101
I'm getting
my money's worth outta you.

13:10.651 --> 13:11.771
-Now let's get to work.
-[WORM] Huh?

13:11.851 --> 13:13.441
[JOOHEON] Rehypnotize the kids,

13:13.521 --> 13:16.401
then have them pack up
all the tea leaves and saplings.

13:16.481 --> 13:18.401
- We're leaving.
-[WORM] What?

13:18.481 --> 13:20.441
Shennong's relic won't be happy.

13:20.521 --> 13:22.441
I'm not paying for back talk!

13:23.061 --> 13:24.021
[WORM] Speaking of,

13:24.311 --> 13:26.561
this job will cost you
another 70 grand.

13:26.651 --> 13:27.981
You need even more money now?

13:28.061 --> 13:30.401
[WORM] That initial fee
is just the down payment.

13:30.481 --> 13:32.441
Every command you give
will cost extra.

13:32.521 --> 13:34.351
I'm not gonna
give you another dime

13:34.441 --> 13:35.981
until we're out of here,
so work!

13:36.061 --> 13:38.441
[worm screaming]
I understand, Master!

13:38.521 --> 13:40.651
Please stop shaking me!

13:41.401 --> 13:42.941
[SHENNONG] You scoundrels!

13:43.021 --> 13:46.401
You would dare plunder my crops
and abandon my field?

13:46.481 --> 13:48.151
[JOOHEON]
Look who decided to show.

13:48.811 --> 13:49.901
-Worm!
-[WORM] Huh?

13:49.981 --> 13:51.061
[JOOHEON] You know
where the exit is.

13:51.151 --> 13:52.151
Guide everyone out.

13:52.691 --> 13:54.351
[WORM] You really will pay me?

13:54.441 --> 13:55.521
I don't do freebies.

13:55.601 --> 13:57.941
Either be a guide
or an earthworm shake.

13:58.021 --> 13:59.151
It's your choice.

13:59.811 --> 14:03.231
[WORM] I'm a fantastic guide.
I even know a shortcut.

14:04.691 --> 14:06.271
Here. Go on ahead.

14:06.901 --> 14:08.311
We can't just leave you behind!

14:08.941 --> 14:10.851
I'm gonna nab Shennong's relic.

14:10.941 --> 14:12.811
I'll follow you
as soon as it's mine.

14:14.021 --> 14:16.351
[SHENNONG]
You intend to claim me?!

14:16.441 --> 14:18.101
[laughs]

14:18.691 --> 14:19.811
[grunts]

14:20.601 --> 14:23.021
-[Shennong growling]
-[Jooheon grunting]

14:23.101 --> 14:24.231
Damn weeds!

14:25.101 --> 14:28.061
[Shennong laughs]
Struggle all you want,

14:28.151 --> 14:29.851
but there's no escape for you!

14:29.941 --> 14:32.151
Not after taking my servants!

14:32.521 --> 14:35.151
I will drag you
into the deepest pits of hell!

14:35.231 --> 14:36.151
[gasps]

14:37.271 --> 14:38.481
[Shennong yells]

14:38.561 --> 14:40.151
[JOOHEON] It's sure persistent.

14:40.231 --> 14:41.271
[IRENE] Jooheon!

14:41.351 --> 14:43.441
-[Shennong grunts]
-[Jooheon grunts]

14:44.941 --> 14:46.271
[gasps]

14:46.851 --> 14:47.811
[gasps]

14:49.481 --> 14:51.311
[grunting]

14:51.401 --> 14:54.311
[screams]

14:56.731 --> 14:58.061
[Irene grunting]

15:00.101 --> 15:01.941
[Irene, Jaeha gasp]

15:03.901 --> 15:05.401
-Where'd he go?
-Oh, man!

15:05.901 --> 15:07.311
[gasps]

15:07.401 --> 15:08.651
The tremors are getting worse!

15:08.731 --> 15:10.061
We're leaving!

15:10.151 --> 15:11.481
-Right now!
-[both panting]

15:18.481 --> 15:21.311
[Jooheon groaning]

15:28.401 --> 15:29.691
Talk about cheap.

15:29.771 --> 15:32.101
[SHENNONG] Ha!
Says the rat who ruined my field

15:32.191 --> 15:33.811
with the cheapest of tricks!

15:33.901 --> 15:36.691
You enticed the worm
into betraying me!

15:39.021 --> 15:41.941
[JOOHEON] Disguised itself
as one of its tea bushes, huh?

15:43.311 --> 15:45.101
Shennong was revered as a god,

15:45.191 --> 15:47.691
so his relic is
probably god-grade.

15:47.771 --> 15:49.851
Dominance might not be enough.

15:52.351 --> 15:55.061
[SHENNONG] Ah.
You've put away your sword.

15:55.151 --> 15:56.811
Giving up already?

15:57.521 --> 15:59.481
You wish. I just got an idea.

15:59.561 --> 16:02.441
[SHENNONG] And what,
pray tell, was this epiphany?

16:03.061 --> 16:04.101
My escape.

16:04.481 --> 16:06.731
Doesn't seem like
there's a way out of this hole.

16:06.811 --> 16:10.151
But then I thought,
"Hey, what if an exit opens up

16:10.231 --> 16:12.651
if the one who owns this tomb
was dead?"

16:12.731 --> 16:13.691
[SHENNONG] What?

16:14.481 --> 16:16.941
[JOOHEON] "The First Ember
of Homo Erectus."

16:17.021 --> 16:20.191
A D-rank relic
I swiped from the CIA.

16:20.901 --> 16:22.311
[SHENNONG] That's your escape?

16:22.401 --> 16:23.691
Blowing the tomb to bits?

16:23.771 --> 16:25.061
And why not?

16:25.151 --> 16:27.101
Thanks to all
your offshoots here,

16:27.191 --> 16:28.691
there's lots of firewood.

16:28.771 --> 16:30.601
One spark,
and everything goes boom.

16:31.231 --> 16:33.101
[SHENNONG] Fool!
You'll perish in the blast!

16:33.191 --> 16:34.771
I doubt it.

16:34.851 --> 16:37.021
See, I'm pretty hard to kill.

16:37.601 --> 16:39.811
You're up, ember,
so give it all you've got!

16:39.901 --> 16:42.941
[FLINT RELIC] Ow, ow, ow!
You're gonna break me!

16:43.561 --> 16:45.311
[SHENNONG] Suicidal lunatic!

16:46.941 --> 16:49.021
You think I'll simply stand by?

16:49.101 --> 16:52.191
-[grunting]
-[Shennong screaming]

16:54.231 --> 16:56.021
[JOOHEON] Set everything ablaze!

16:57.021 --> 16:59.521
[Shennong, flint relic yelling]

17:03.981 --> 17:06.021
-[children yelling]
-[Irene panting]

17:06.101 --> 17:08.561
[JAEHA] Take cover!
The tomb is collapsing!

17:08.651 --> 17:10.151
[yells]

17:10.771 --> 17:13.061
[Irene, Jaeha coughing]

17:14.151 --> 17:14.981
-Do you see him?
-Oh, no!

17:20.731 --> 17:22.101
[IRENE] Jooheon.

17:22.521 --> 17:23.981
[sobbing]

17:25.901 --> 17:27.101
He didn't make it.

17:32.401 --> 17:33.521
[sniffling]

17:33.601 --> 17:34.481
[gasps]

17:34.561 --> 17:35.771
[Jooheon chuckles]

17:35.851 --> 17:37.231
Why the long faces?

17:39.101 --> 17:40.561
[all gasp]

17:42.981 --> 17:44.191
[Jooheon chuckles]

17:44.271 --> 17:45.561
So many tears.

17:45.651 --> 17:47.231
I miss someone's funeral?

17:49.941 --> 17:51.481
Then, you're okay?

17:52.231 --> 17:54.271
Boss, I thought you died!

17:54.351 --> 17:55.851
It just collapsed on you!

17:56.521 --> 17:58.101
Why do you think it collapsed?

17:58.481 --> 18:00.401
'Cause it was just sealed
by yours truly.

18:00.481 --> 18:01.811
[sniffling]

18:01.901 --> 18:03.151
I swear.

18:03.231 --> 18:04.731
[sighs]

18:04.811 --> 18:07.021
Think my heart stopped
for a second.

18:07.101 --> 18:09.061
Jaeha seemed really
choked up about it too.

18:09.151 --> 18:10.151
'Course I was!

18:10.231 --> 18:11.351
Wait, time out!

18:11.441 --> 18:13.441
I was worried
'cause you're my employer!

18:13.521 --> 18:15.311
It was from a pragmatic mindset!

18:15.401 --> 18:17.101
I'd be out of a stable day job

18:17.191 --> 18:19.101
if you just went
and bit the dust!

18:19.191 --> 18:21.191
So you could say
the one I was most worried about

18:21.271 --> 18:22.271
-was me!
-[JOOHEON] Good to know.

18:22.351 --> 18:23.731
[JAEHA] Huh?

18:23.811 --> 18:25.651
You're still very much employed.

18:25.731 --> 18:27.101
And guess what?

18:27.191 --> 18:29.401
You have two more relics
in need of restoration.

18:30.061 --> 18:32.811
Hold up.
Is this the First Ember?

18:32.901 --> 18:33.851
Then this?

18:33.941 --> 18:35.601
Is Shennong's relic.

18:35.691 --> 18:37.401
I gave it
the roasting it deserved.

18:37.481 --> 18:39.101
-[relics groaning]
-[JOOHEON] And the flint relic,

18:39.191 --> 18:42.311
well, it just happened to be
the perfect makeshift bomb.

18:42.401 --> 18:44.191
They're more like charcoal
than relics.

18:44.271 --> 18:45.311
[JOOHEON] So?

18:45.981 --> 18:48.601
Fix them. Unless you're saying
that you can't.

18:48.691 --> 18:51.311
[JAEHA] No! I can fix them up
just fine! I promise!

18:51.401 --> 18:52.561
[chuckles, sighs]

18:52.651 --> 18:54.311
Why was I relieved to see him?

19:00.941 --> 19:03.441
[♪ playing whimsical melody]

19:03.521 --> 19:06.811
[TREE] Ah. Simply wonderful.

19:07.981 --> 19:09.851
That drink hit the spot.

19:09.941 --> 19:11.191
Sheesh.

19:11.521 --> 19:14.401
Of all the jobs, how did I get
reduced to being a gardener?

19:14.481 --> 19:16.901
Actually, I'm more like
the tree's personal butler.

19:16.981 --> 19:18.311
When will it end?

19:19.351 --> 19:21.311
[cell phone buzzing]

19:21.401 --> 19:22.311
Huh?

19:25.941 --> 19:27.481
Hey, boss. What's up?

19:27.561 --> 19:30.441
Been a while since you called.
I don't even know where you are.

19:31.191 --> 19:33.311
New York? Right. For sure.

19:33.401 --> 19:34.441
First thing tomorrow.

19:34.521 --> 19:35.441
You got it.

19:36.061 --> 19:37.771
-[chuckles]
-What'd the boss have to say?

19:39.191 --> 19:40.601
[SEUNGWOO] Pack up, boys.

19:41.441 --> 19:42.981
Looks like we're finally free.

19:44.191 --> 19:45.601
[traffic bustling]

19:45.691 --> 19:46.981
[JAEHA] Boss.

19:47.061 --> 19:49.151
Earth to boss.

19:49.811 --> 19:52.311
-Come. In. Boss!
-[gasps]

19:54.021 --> 19:55.101
Are we there yet?

19:55.191 --> 19:56.941
We're still stuck in traffic.

19:57.021 --> 19:58.901
-[sighs]
-We'll get there soon enough.

19:58.981 --> 20:00.811
No one at the house will
answer their phones, though,

20:00.901 --> 20:02.151
and I don't know why.

20:02.231 --> 20:04.481
Our chauffeur's silence
is one thing,

20:04.561 --> 20:06.521
but not even George
is responding to texts

20:06.601 --> 20:07.651
or calls right now.

20:07.731 --> 20:09.271
[yawns]

20:09.351 --> 20:10.731
I wouldn't sweat it much.

20:10.811 --> 20:13.481
We're one traffic jam away.
Right?

20:13.561 --> 20:15.021
So your parents
will be healed real s--

20:15.101 --> 20:16.101
[cell phone buzzing]

20:17.651 --> 20:18.691
Seungwoo?

20:20.021 --> 20:20.981
-What?
-[Seungwoo whimpering]

20:21.061 --> 20:22.561
Boss! We've got a problem!

20:22.651 --> 20:23.811
We were heading
to the rendezvous

20:23.901 --> 20:25.691
when some dudes
started tailing us!

20:25.771 --> 20:27.021
You're being chased?

20:27.101 --> 20:28.651
[SEUNGWOO]
I think they're after the tree!

20:28.731 --> 20:30.021
[JOOHEON] Is it Kiera?

20:30.101 --> 20:31.731
She has the means
to investigate me,

20:31.811 --> 20:33.101
so it's possible.

20:33.771 --> 20:35.311
We're changing
the rendezvous point.

20:35.401 --> 20:36.601
Just lose those goons.

20:37.231 --> 20:38.851
Better not let them catch you.

20:38.941 --> 20:41.191
Or I'll make sure
you die a brutal death.

20:41.271 --> 20:42.481
-[SEUNGWOO] What?
-[hangs up]

20:43.521 --> 20:44.941
Sounds like
there might be a problem

20:45.021 --> 20:46.941
with the colleagues
that we're supposed to meet.

20:47.021 --> 20:48.981
[smirks] They'll be fine.

20:49.061 --> 20:51.021
My guys are craftier
than you'd think.

20:51.691 --> 20:53.481
Driver.
Could you pick up the pace?

20:53.561 --> 20:55.441
[JAEHA] If the road
wasn't packed tighter

20:55.521 --> 20:57.151
than a can of sardines.

20:58.771 --> 21:00.651
It's not usually this backed up.

21:00.731 --> 21:01.941
Just caught an unlucky break.

21:02.021 --> 21:03.021
-[explosion]
-Uh?

21:03.101 --> 21:04.941
-[gasps]
-Was that a car?

21:05.021 --> 21:06.191
[both gasp]

21:06.811 --> 21:08.481
Jooheon's people
have the healing relic,

21:08.561 --> 21:10.101
so if something bad
happens to them,

21:10.191 --> 21:11.441
we'll lose the healing relic

21:11.521 --> 21:13.101
and the chance
to save my parents.

21:13.191 --> 21:14.401
[both exclaiming]

21:14.481 --> 21:17.101
[JAEHA] Irene, think nice,
soothing thoughts!

21:17.191 --> 21:18.481
[siren wailing in distance]

21:22.151 --> 21:24.981
[panting]

21:25.061 --> 21:27.521
We managed to lose the goons
and secure the tree!

21:30.151 --> 21:32.101
[♪ closing theme song playing]
